I take my bicycle to the shop.
The shop is right near my home.
I see a mechanic there.
I greet him politely.
I say, "Namaste bhaiya."
"This is my bicycle."
"I ride it sometimes."
"Therefore, service is needed now."
"Please fix it well."
The mechanic looks at the bicycle.
He says, "Okay madam, I will fix it well."
I ask him, "When do I come?"
"At what time do I come here?"
The mechanic thinks a little.
He says, "Come on Thursday."
"Come in the evening at seven o'clock."
I say, "Okay, Thursday at seven o'clock."
"I always exercise in the evening."
"After exercise, I will certainly come."
He smiles, "Okay madam."
